{
  "bvid": "BV1mz4y1t7SF",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "7fa53e4a291ee175bfbdf8bec568f5a6f880d11fbe74d8fc933106cda38e43e6",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 660,
      "end_ms": 8639,
      "text": "我啊就现在可能这个就业形势啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 8639,
      "end_ms": 11459,
      "text": "有点稍微就不景气了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 11459,
      "end_ms": 12490,
      "text": "经济不景气了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 12490,
      "end_ms": 14650,
      "text": "如果你有你认识的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 14650,
      "end_ms": 15430,
      "text": "或者你的朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 15430,
      "end_ms": 16690,
      "text": "或者是一个陌生人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 16690,
      "end_ms": 18310,
      "text": "特别是互联网上的一些人物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 18310,
      "end_ms": 19630,
      "text": "说他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 19630,
      "end_ms": 21840,
      "text": "要你要得到你的帮助"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 22120,
      "end_ms": 23500,
      "text": "我们再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 24640,
      "end_ms": 27260,
      "text": "无论他打着什么样的旗号幌子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 27759,
      "end_ms": 29019,
      "text": "考虑到你自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 30999,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "或者说只是一个啊中底层的底层的小资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 35140,
      "end_ms": 36970,
      "text": "你也承担失业的风险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 36970,
      "end_ms": 38860,
      "text": "他要得到你的帮助"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 38860,
      "end_ms": 40879,
      "text": "起码他要证明他事业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 42700,
      "end_ms": 43980,
      "text": "尤其是陌生人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 43980,
      "end_ms": 45390,
      "text": "他说他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 45390,
      "end_ms": 47239,
      "text": "他要给出他的证明"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 48820,
      "end_ms": 49620,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 49620,
      "end_ms": 50940,
      "text": "我们要避免一种情况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 50940,
      "end_ms": 59740,
      "text": "就是说在我也就是这个叫做财务大逃杀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 59740,
      "end_ms": 60640,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 60640,
      "end_ms": 62680,
      "text": "不能变成财务大逃杀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 63620,
      "end_ms": 66580,
      "text": "要避免一种财务大逃杀的状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 66860,
      "end_ms": 69620,
      "text": "他这是陷入了债务债务漏洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 69620,
      "end_ms": 71880,
      "text": "比如说他房贷还不上了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 72300,
      "end_ms": 75260,
      "text": "或者说他他投机的一些股票"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 75260,
      "end_ms": 78020,
      "text": "尤其是最喜欢一天到晚研究经济"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 78020,
      "end_ms": 79610,
      "text": "整这些乱七八糟的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 79610,
      "end_ms": 82430,
      "text": "他宣称自己是所谓的失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 82430,
      "end_ms": 83679,
      "text": "他的证据呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 84780,
      "end_ms": 88400,
      "text": "他当然有可能是炒股票炒的亏钱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 88400,
      "end_ms": 89619,
      "text": "欠债了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 90560,
      "end_ms": 91660,
      "text": "那么在这种情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 91660,
      "end_ms": 93039,
      "text": "应当借钱给他吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 93220,
      "end_ms": 95920,
      "text": "或者应当甚至说应当给钱给他吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 95920,
      "end_ms": 97600,
      "text": "你如果他是你的朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 97600,
      "end_ms": 99759,
      "text": "你倒想想我要不要借钱给他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 99780,
      "end_ms": 103360,
      "text": "既然现在在互联网上出现了一某些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 103360,
      "end_ms": 105160,
      "text": "打着一个什么左翼的一个旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 106630,
      "end_ms": 108820,
      "text": "扮演所谓的社会良心的旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 108820,
      "end_ms": 110140,
      "text": "全社会都不知道他是谁的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 110140,
      "end_ms": 111539,
      "text": "一个所谓的社会良心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 114140,
      "end_ms": 115540,
      "text": "他扮演他一个人设"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 115540,
      "end_ms": 117040,
      "text": "他是个什么一个知识分子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 117040,
      "end_ms": 119020,
      "text": "一个什么什么那种人设"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 119020,
      "end_ms": 119680,
      "text": "有良心的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 119680,
      "end_ms": 120520,
      "text": "有道德的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 120520,
      "end_ms": 123439,
      "text": "或者说甚至他会他会让他的拥趸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 123439,
      "end_ms": 125839,
      "text": "或者说他的粉丝去渲染一个讨厌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 125839,
      "end_ms": 129190,
      "text": "在地下密谋搞着搞着一个什么神圣的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 129190,
      "end_ms": 132730,
      "text": "什么不得了的布尔什维克性质的那种活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 132730,
      "end_ms": 134600,
      "text": "渲染出这么一个形象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 135420,
      "end_ms": 137150,
      "text": "他宣称他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 137150,
      "end_ms": 138220,
      "text": "证据呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 141439,
      "end_ms": 143259,
      "text": "天天进行经济观察"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 143259,
      "end_ms": 144219,
      "text": "天天进行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 144219,
      "end_ms": 147789,
      "text": "使我们的甚至说在他那个知搞了个知识星球"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 147789,
      "end_ms": 151969,
      "text": "198块钱1年就白嫖嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 151969,
      "end_ms": 154159,
      "text": "相当于就是说里面的内容"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 154159,
      "end_ms": 157200,
      "text": "就是之前的那些东西重新搜集了一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 157280,
      "end_ms": 158720,
      "text": "在这种情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 158720,
      "end_ms": 160780,
      "text": "你怎么确定他是失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 163020,
      "end_ms": 164980,
      "text": "他要证明他事业的呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 165420,
      "end_ms": 167250,
      "text": "他证明他困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 167250,
      "end_ms": 170100,
      "text": "他证明说他弄到这些钱是度过困难的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 170100,
      "end_ms": 172620,
      "text": "不是说去奢侈享乐的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 173279,
      "end_ms": 176059,
      "text": "不是说去投这个投机炒股"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 176059,
      "end_ms": 178279,
      "text": "或者说为他自己之前投机炒股"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 178279,
      "end_ms": 180269,
      "text": "搞出来的债务擦屁股的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 180269,
      "end_ms": 183299,
      "text": "或者说他买房子投机都有可能的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 183299,
      "end_ms": 184859,
      "text": "不是为了他投机擦屁股"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 184859,
      "end_ms": 186160,
      "text": "他得证明啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 188140,
      "end_ms": 190740,
      "text": "那目前就看已经有70个人去买"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 190740,
      "end_ms": 192000,
      "text": "他这个198的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 192000,
      "end_ms": 194280,
      "text": "那就已经是14000块钱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 195559,
      "end_ms": 197379,
      "text": "他对外宣称他是失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 198759,
      "end_ms": 200540,
      "text": "他段位宣称他是失业哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 202420,
      "end_ms": 203520,
      "text": "他到底有没有事业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 203520,
      "end_ms": 204660,
      "text": "他到底这个人是谁了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 206460,
      "end_ms": 210139,
      "text": "如果很多购买他这个知识星球服务的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 210139,
      "end_ms": 212359,
      "text": "并不是说真的是要去消费他这个服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 212359,
      "end_ms": 214639,
      "text": "而是出于认识到他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 214639,
      "end_ms": 216019,
      "text": "想要给他提供帮助"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 216019,
      "end_ms": 217459,
      "text": "他如果他这个事业是假的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 217459,
      "end_ms": 218719,
      "text": "他构成诈骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 218719,
      "end_ms": 221060,
      "text": "构成刑事犯罪的诈骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 222040,
      "end_ms": 224100,
      "text": "所以我我敦促我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 224100,
      "end_ms": 227930,
      "text": "甚至警告这个匿名扮演一个左翼社会良心的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 227930,
      "end_ms": 229310,
      "text": "这么一个所谓的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 229310,
      "end_ms": 230570,
      "text": "不知道他是不是小智分子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 230570,
      "end_ms": 232220,
      "text": "他是一个人还是一群人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 232440,
      "end_ms": 235140,
      "text": "你至少要给出你事业的证据"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 236559,
      "end_ms": 238259,
      "text": "你要你要让别人知道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 238259,
      "end_ms": 242100,
      "text": "你这钱确实是用来度过你的生活的难关的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 242980,
      "end_ms": 245940,
      "text": "他已经在公开的在互联网上发动态的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 245940,
      "end_ms": 246780,
      "text": "确实他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 246780,
      "end_ms": 248500,
      "text": "然后很多人要支持他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 248500,
      "end_ms": 250420,
      "text": "是确实是出于要支持他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 250420,
      "end_ms": 252520,
      "text": "确实是出于要帮他渡过难关"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 252520,
      "end_ms": 254860,
      "text": "所以才去搞了他这个知识付费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 254860,
      "end_ms": 257680,
      "text": "所以才去包括进到他那个知识付费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 257680,
      "end_ms": 260050,
      "text": "那个知识星球里面发的那个东西也是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 260050,
      "end_ms": 262760,
      "text": "过来给你帮帮忙渡过难关"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 263060,
      "end_ms": 264860,
      "text": "但它如果它是假的呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 266240,
      "end_ms": 267740,
      "text": "那就构成诈骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 268600,
      "end_ms": 271440,
      "text": "我是说如果我并没有说他一定是诈骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 271860,
      "end_ms": 273510,
      "text": "他到底有没有事业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 273510,
      "end_ms": 274860,
      "text": "所以同样的道理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 274860,
      "end_ms": 276030,
      "text": "你是个普通人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 276030,
      "end_ms": 277440,
      "text": "你现在财务状况还可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 277440,
      "end_ms": 278880,
      "text": "你你手上还有一个工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 278880,
      "end_ms": 280020,
      "text": "还有一份饭碗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 281020,
      "end_ms": 282360,
      "text": "如果有你的朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 282360,
      "end_ms": 283860,
      "text": "忽然之间跑过来说他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 283860,
      "end_ms": 284730,
      "text": "跟你要钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 284730,
      "end_ms": 286530,
      "text": "你也你们也长长心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 286530,
      "end_ms": 288690,
      "text": "因为不一定能明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 288690,
      "end_ms": 291080,
      "text": "因为有可能他是陷入财务陷阱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 291759,
      "end_ms": 292499,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 292499,
      "end_ms": 295040,
      "text": "他不一定是就是说缺生活费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 295680,
      "end_ms": 297080,
      "text": "他不一定是缺生活"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 297080,
      "end_ms": 299780,
      "text": "因为一个缺生活费的状状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 299780,
      "end_ms": 304590,
      "text": "他哪怕出去做一些服务性的去说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 304590,
      "end_ms": 306360,
      "text": "就是说他贩卖这题劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 306360,
      "end_ms": 307320,
      "text": "他有饭吃啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 307320,
      "end_ms": 307980,
      "text": "总归有饭吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 307980,
      "end_ms": 310160,
      "text": "他说他租金迫不及他回老家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 312440,
      "end_ms": 315300,
      "text": "他为什么一下子要要要要这么多钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 316900,
      "end_ms": 319360,
      "text": "那不是说度过一个生活困难的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 319719,
      "end_ms": 322269,
      "text": "他如果一下子要很多钱的情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 322269,
      "end_ms": 324099,
      "text": "或者说他一下子就越多越好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 324099,
      "end_ms": 325220,
      "text": "我来者不拒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 325479,
      "end_ms": 326619,
      "text": "你有多少多少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 326619,
      "end_ms": 327609,
      "text": "200块钱一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 327609,
      "end_ms": 329259,
      "text": "那七七十个就14000"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 329259,
      "end_ms": 332040,
      "text": "那7000个我算不过来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 332040,
      "end_ms": 335120,
      "text": "我靠140万"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 338100,
      "end_ms": 339170,
      "text": "类似的嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 339170,
      "end_ms": 343980,
      "text": "我要讲的这当中是具有危险性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 344180,
      "end_ms": 345800,
      "text": "我始终提醒你们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 345800,
      "end_ms": 346760,
      "text": "他没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 346760,
      "end_ms": 349040,
      "text": "尤其是当你的朋友或者这么一个陌生人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 349040,
      "end_ms": 351120,
      "text": "没有给出任何证据的情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 353160,
      "end_ms": 356330,
      "text": "你不知道你给他的钱是填一个无底洞的窟窿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 356330,
      "end_ms": 357980,
      "text": "你也不知道这个钱到底是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 357980,
      "end_ms": 360020,
      "text": "就是他出于自己的私人享乐"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 360020,
      "end_ms": 362800,
      "text": "或者说啊就是要骗取现金的一个目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 362800,
      "end_ms": 364480,
      "text": "还是真承认是生活困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 364480,
      "end_ms": 365080,
      "text": "你生活困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 365080,
      "end_ms": 366560,
      "text": "你证明你生活困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 366659,
      "end_ms": 367739,
      "text": "你说你失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 367739,
      "end_ms": 368699,
      "text": "你证明你失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 368699,
      "end_ms": 369899,
      "text": "你光是失业了还不行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 369899,
      "end_ms": 371219,
      "text": "失业的人多了去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 371219,
      "end_ms": 372330,
      "text": "我也失业啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 372330,
      "end_ms": 374280,
      "text": "我只不过自己我去搞了个公司"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 374280,
      "end_ms": 375390,
      "text": "你就变成我不失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 375390,
      "end_ms": 377150,
      "text": "我也没有说被别人雇佣嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 377150,
      "end_ms": 378950,
      "text": "我现在也是我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 380750,
      "end_ms": 381590,
      "text": "社保都没交"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 381590,
      "end_ms": 382430,
      "text": "我就交了个医保"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 382430,
      "end_ms": 383440,
      "text": "社区医保"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 384740,
      "end_ms": 385660,
      "text": "you can stand"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 386920,
      "end_ms": 388540,
      "text": "他不能说他失失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 388540,
      "end_ms": 390660,
      "text": "他就就白嫖钱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 391360,
      "end_ms": 393540,
      "text": "希望你们明白想清楚这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 393640,
      "end_ms": 396160,
      "text": "尤其是他很明确在互联网上公开的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 396160,
      "end_ms": 396700,
      "text": "他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 396700,
      "end_ms": 398590,
      "text": "以这种方式来博取同情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 398590,
      "end_ms": 400120,
      "text": "来那些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 400120,
      "end_ms": 403240,
      "text": "很多人给钱也是出于一个认知到他失业了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 403240,
      "end_ms": 404360,
      "text": "然后给他钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 405560,
      "end_ms": 407140,
      "text": "尤其在这种情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 409000,
      "end_ms": 409880,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 410340,
      "end_ms": 414200,
      "text": "希望而且我这种白惨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 414200,
      "end_ms": 416540,
      "text": "而且是匿名陌生人更是如此了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 416540,
      "end_ms": 418820,
      "text": "白惨白惨要给出证据了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 418820,
      "end_ms": 420160,
      "text": "你到底怎么惨法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 420680,
      "end_ms": 422660,
      "text": "包括在我的直播间的下面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 422660,
      "end_ms": 424880,
      "text": "评论区里面也有人被骗上当的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 424880,
      "end_ms": 426710,
      "text": "我看到了我就会删那个留言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 426710,
      "end_ms": 428290,
      "text": "我有的时候我来不及删"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 428290,
      "end_ms": 430450,
      "text": "一人发他什么在成都流浪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 430450,
      "end_ms": 431560,
      "text": "什么没饭吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 431680,
      "end_ms": 433420,
      "text": "那你有本事发个自己的经"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 433420,
      "end_ms": 435480,
      "text": "你有个手机给自己拍个照片呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 435500,
      "end_ms": 436370,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 436370,
      "end_ms": 437840,
      "text": "你姓甚名谁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 437840,
      "end_ms": 439280,
      "text": "你实名信息给出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 439280,
      "end_ms": 440600,
      "text": "你承担法律责任啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 440600,
      "end_ms": 441560,
      "text": "承担法律风险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 441560,
      "end_ms": 442730,
      "text": "你表明你没有被骗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 442730,
      "end_ms": 444560,
      "text": "没有没有在骗别人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 445639,
      "end_ms": 446439,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 446439,
      "end_ms": 447459,
      "text": "我再强调一遍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 447459,
      "end_ms": 448659,
      "text": "那个什么那个家伙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 448659,
      "end_ms": 450220,
      "text": "他是匿名在活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 451900,
      "end_ms": 454320,
      "text": "你说你咋知道他注册那个什么知乎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 454320,
      "end_ms": 455340,
      "text": "到底是个什么账号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 455340,
      "end_ms": 456680,
      "text": "什么手机要注册的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 459480,
      "end_ms": 461060,
      "text": "他是搞的那个人设"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 461060,
      "end_ms": 461660,
      "text": "他是谁谁谁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 461660,
      "end_ms": 463000,
      "text": "到底是谁谁谁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 467120,
      "end_ms": 468010,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 468010,
      "end_ms": 469880,
      "text": "我希望你们想清楚一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 470140,
      "end_ms": 471940,
      "text": "不是说他做了几个视频"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 471940,
      "end_ms": 473140,
      "text": "发了多少个文章"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 473140,
      "end_ms": 474730,
      "text": "还搞了一个调查"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 474730,
      "end_ms": 476740,
      "text": "他倒是把别人的姓名姓陈名"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 476740,
      "end_ms": 477850,
      "text": "谁都调查清楚了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 477850,
      "end_ms": 481440,
      "text": "他自己呢有风险很大的风险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 481440,
      "end_ms": 483660,
      "text": "我希望你们所有人讲清楚他到底有没有失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 483660,
      "end_ms": 485190,
      "text": "那拿证据出来呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 485190,
      "end_ms": 486620,
      "text": "姓生名谁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 488060,
      "end_ms": 488860,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 490300,
      "end_ms": 493680,
      "text": "他或者说他他他有没有陷入债务风险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 493840,
      "end_ms": 495160,
      "text": "就拼命的要求还债"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 495160,
      "end_ms": 497410,
      "text": "欠了一大笔屁股债的负责"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 497410,
      "end_ms": 498160,
      "text": "没纸巾啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 498160,
      "end_ms": 499360,
      "text": "你弄了这么多钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 499360,
      "end_ms": 502220,
      "text": "你一下子要要要几万块钱的生活费吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 503940,
      "end_ms": 504920,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 504920,
      "end_ms": 507650,
      "text": "他这个钱能就真的是你自己生活困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 507650,
      "end_ms": 510800,
      "text": "还是说你的房贷还不上了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 511300,
      "end_ms": 512440,
      "text": "那房贷还不上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 512440,
      "end_ms": 514280,
      "text": "那你当年为什么买那么大房子呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 514600,
      "end_ms": 515740,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 515740,
      "end_ms": 517390,
      "text": "或者投机准备什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 517390,
      "end_ms": 518740,
      "text": "让出去要去走线啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 518740,
      "end_ms": 519280,
      "text": "还是怎么回事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 519280,
      "end_ms": 520240,
      "text": "到底怎么回事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 520240,
      "end_ms": 521080,
      "text": "要说清楚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 521080,
      "end_ms": 523120,
      "text": "这笔钱到底用到哪里去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 524380,
      "end_ms": 526060,
      "text": "明白我说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 526060,
      "end_ms": 526660,
      "text": "我让你们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 526660,
      "end_ms": 528250,
      "text": "比如说你们买我店里的勋章"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 528250,
      "end_ms": 531580,
      "text": "我承诺说这里面的利润的绝大部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 531580,
      "end_ms": 536250,
      "text": "一大部分我用来去请工人群众吃饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 536250,
      "end_ms": 537680,
      "text": "那是不是天天都在吃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 537860,
      "end_ms": 542090,
      "text": "之前新型家园的那个主题馆的勋章也是的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 542090,
      "end_ms": 543840,
      "text": "已经全都花光了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 543840,
      "end_ms": 545760,
      "text": "他们天天在吃面面包牛奶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 545760,
      "end_ms": 548430,
      "text": "我现在那个星星家园那个勋章里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 548430,
      "end_ms": 550620,
      "text": "那个改造费6000多块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 550620,
      "end_ms": 552300,
      "text": "改造费已经9000块了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 552400,
      "end_ms": 554860,
      "text": "改造费我们自己我自己私人掏腰包"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 554860,
      "end_ms": 555700,
      "text": "掏了3000块"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 555700,
      "end_ms": 557080,
      "text": "6000多块钱是个材料费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 557080,
      "end_ms": 557980,
      "text": "我只算材料费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 557980,
      "end_ms": 559500,
      "text": "我没有算我的什么邮费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 559500,
      "end_ms": 560040,
      "text": "什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 560040,
      "end_ms": 562710,
      "text": "请那些志愿者吃饭的钱我都没算"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 562710,
      "end_ms": 563700,
      "text": "算进去的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 563700,
      "end_ms": 565699,
      "text": "那个他妈1万多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 566300,
      "end_ms": 567460,
      "text": "你说我为什么没钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 567460,
      "end_ms": 569890,
      "text": "因为我钱他妈都花掉了好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 569890,
      "end_ms": 573310,
      "text": "然后我们还把当时的那些钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 573310,
      "end_ms": 576280,
      "text": "剩下的那3000块钱说给他们发牛奶面包"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 576700,
      "end_ms": 578800,
      "text": "那我们店里的牛肉面都是免费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 578800,
      "end_ms": 582459,
      "text": "或者当时的那个快餐都是免费给给他们的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 582460,
      "end_ms": 583900,
      "text": "一个星期送两次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 583900,
      "end_ms": 585550,
      "text": "一顿是牛肉面或者快餐"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 585550,
      "end_ms": 587800,
      "text": "一顿是牛奶面包"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 588420,
      "end_ms": 591110,
      "text": "现在我们都明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 591110,
      "end_ms": 593520,
